### MediCitas — RF14 pacientes/contactos + RF16 historial
### Requiere: docker compose up

@host = http://localhost:8080
@kc = http://localhost:6767
@realm = medicitas
@client = api

### Token recepción norte
# @name tokenRecep
POST {{kc}}/realms/{{realm}}/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

client_id={{client}}&username=recep-norte&password=recep123&grant_type=password

### Listar pacientes (I5: clinicaId se ignora)
GET {{host}}/pacientes?clinicaId=clinica-sur
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenRecep.response.body.access_token}}

### Crear paciente + contactos (RF14)
# @name crearPaciente
POST {{host}}/pacientes
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenRecep.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identificacion": "1-1111-9999",
  "nombre": "Paciente Demo",
  "fechaNacimiento": "1992-08-15",
  "contactos": [
    { "tipoCodigo": "telefono", "valor": "+50688880000", "esPrincipal": true },
    { "tipoCodigo": "email", "valor": "demo@medicitas.local", "esPrincipal": true }
  ]
}

### Detalle paciente
GET {{host}}/pacientes/{{pacienteId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenRecep.response.body.access_token}}

### Actualizar paciente
PATCH {{host}}/pacientes/{{pacienteId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenRecep.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Paciente Demo Actualizado"
}

### Agregar contacto
POST {{host}}/pacientes/{{pacienteId}}/contactos
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenRecep.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tipoCodigo": "direccion",
  "valor": "San José, Costa Rica",
  "esPrincipal": true
}

### Historial de citas (RF16)
GET {{host}}/pacientes/{{pacienteId}}/citas
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenRecep.response.body.access_token}}

### Token profesional (puede leer, no escribir)
# @name tokenProf
POST {{kc}}/realms/{{realm}}/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

client_id={{client}}&username=dra-garcia&password={{$dotenv SEED_USER_PASSWORD}}&grant_type=password

GET {{host}}/pacientes
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenProf.response.body.access_token}}

POST {{host}}/pacientes
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenProf.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identificacion": "x",
  "nombre": "no",
  "fechaNacimiento": "1990-01-01"
}
